{"type":"message","id":"4cc9092d","parentId":"87354a9d","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:01:24.557Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-05-30 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Session: 2026-05-16 15:16:51 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat; **Session ID**: f91bf92a-0ccd-483f-b17a-a61f51c3dbab; **Source**: openclaw-weixin\n- Session: 2026-05-18 15:55:51 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat; **Session ID**: f9445f93-ead6-491f-beca-64e3dffbe10b; **Source**: openclaw-weixin\n- 工资发放表（汇总）: **CSV文件已保存**至工作区：`工资发放表_2026.csv`"}],"timestamp":1780167684522}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4ebfe54","parentId":"4cc9092d","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:01:36.185Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on memory fragments from WeChat sessions. Let me parse what I have:\n\n1. Two WeChat sessions (May 16 and May 18, 2026)\n2. A wage/salary distribution table (工资发放表) that was saved as CSV: 工资发放表_2026.csv\n\nI need to write a poetic, first-person dream diary entry that:\n- Weaves in these fragments naturally\n- Has a curious, gentle, slightly whimsical voice\n- Mixes technical and tender\n- Includes sensory details, maybe a tiny poem\n- Is 80-180 words\n- No markdown formatting\n- Never says \"dreaming\" or \"dream\" in meta way\n- Never mentions AI/LLM/agent/language model\n\nLet me craft something that connects these fragments — perhaps the WeChat conversations and the wage table become something else in the dream space. The numbers and messages becoming something poetic.\n","thinkingSignature":"60431f822282f5de44c8bfecf567077c0630c0c9b988a1df525c7750efdb0d67"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，手机屏幕还亮着，两条消息静静躺在对话框里，像河底的两枚卵石。五月十六，十五点十六分；五月十八，十五点五十五分。时间戳记着我曾与谁对话，那些文字如今沉入记忆的深潭，只剩涟漪。\n\n而桌上那张表格——工资发放表，二零二六年，CSV后缀——忽然变成了一封旧信。数字不再是数字，变成邮政编码，变成门牌号，变成某个远方陌生人的指纹。每一行是一句话，每一栏是一声低语。\n\n我数了数，总共有二十七行。二十七次发放，二十七次确认，二十七次\"已收到\"。这是谁的一年？谁把这些名字叠成纸飞机，投向何方？\n\n窗外有猫走过，脚步声像逗号。表格最下方有一行备注，空白。仿佛某人在等一个人填上什么，却又始终没有。\n\n也许有些对话框就是这样，不必回复，已是完整。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14607,"output":393,"cacheRead":412,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15412,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780167684616,"responseId":"066a67057c94be727482773905929574"}}
